      "details": "<p class=\"p1\"><em>T\u016bnis</em>: The capital city of the country of Africa.\u00a0It is situated on a saltwater lake that is ten miles distant from the sea. It is a great ancient city whose plants are abundant and whose agriculture is plentiful. [translation]</p>",
